{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:0.4", "PA_ja_236:1.1"], "en": "6. The Bakajātaka “Excellent indeed is this bird,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:1.2"], "en": "a twice-born one resembling a white water-lily;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:1.3", "PA_ja_236:1.4"], "en": "With his wings stilled, he meditates very gently.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:2.1"], "en": "You do not know his virtue; [he said].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:2.2"], "en": "\"You praise him without knowing;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:2.3"], "en": "the bird does not protect us,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:2.4"], "en": "and for that reason the winged one does not stir.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_236:3.1"], "en": "The Bakajātaka is the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
